			"notes": "* Map-Database setting is now public, although disabled by default. Use ip `db.evmodder.net` to connect\n* Added NewMapNotifier\n* New default auto-created `/mapartgroup`: `seen/2b2t.org`\n* Auto-MapArt-Placer now works with x/SIZE name format\n* Better map-metadata tooltips\n* Many previously-hidden hardcoded config values are now accessible, and even more can be exposed by enabling `show_niche_config_settings:true` in `settings.txt`\n* Big rework of config in general, including where files are stored, what things are named, and how features are loaded. I **STRONGLY** recommend deleting all \"EvMod\"/\"KeyBound\" files from your `.minecraft` instance folder and letting v2.0 generate fresh ones, to avoid stuff breaking, settings becoming invisible, or just unused/dead file clutter."
		},
